<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hanwha wins $35.4 mln bearing order.</title>
<headline>Hanwha wins $35.4 mln bearing order.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Hanwha Machinery Co said in a statement on Monday that it has won a $35.4 million order to supply bearings to the U.S.-based Borg Warner Automotive Inc.</p>
<p>It said Hanwha would supply 14 million bearings over three years from February.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
